meta {
  name: GetWordDetail
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{url}}elberfelder/wordDetail/wordId/:wordId
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  wordId: 1
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Try word ids: a person (NT, Paul in Acts) and a place, then any word in an NT verse that has a variant apparatus (e.g. Matthew 1:5).

  readings[].entity { kind: person|place, name, brief }: STEP person/place list entry matched by the
  reading's Strong's number (exact, including the letter suffix). English STEP text, shown live (CC BY).
  hints contains "textVariants" when the SBLGNT apparatus has rows for the verse (NT only). Only the hint,
  no apparatus text, is returned.
}
